   "question": "חשבו את האינטגרל $\\int\\frac{dx}{\\cos^2x+4\\cos^4x}$.",
   "solution": "$$\\int\\frac{dx}{\\cos^2x+4\\cos^4x}=\\left\\{\\begin{matrix}\\tan x=t,\\quad x=\\arctan t,\\quad dx=\\frac{dt}{1+t^2}\\\\\\cos^2x=\\frac1{1+t^2}\\end{matrix}\\right\\}=$$\n$$=\\int\\frac{\\frac{dt}{1+t^2}}{\\frac1{1+t^2}+\\frac4{\\left(1+t^2\\right)^2}}=\\int\\frac{\\left(1+t^2\\right)dt}{5+t^2}=\\int\\left(1-\\frac4{5+t^2}\\right)dt=$$\n$$=t-\\frac4{\\sqrt5}\\arctan\\frac t{\\sqrt5}=\\tan x-\\frac4{\\sqrt5}\\arctan\\frac{\\tan x}{\\sqrt5}+C$$",
