   "questionHtml": "חשבו בקירוב באמצעות דיפרנציאל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>0.1</mn></msup></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi e^{0.1}}{6}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. (ידוע כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin(\\pi/6)=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos(\\pi/6)=\\sqrt3/2</annotation></semantics></math></span>).",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi e^x}{6}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta x=0.1,\\quad x_0=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(0)=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2},\\qquad y&#x27;(x)=-\\frac\\pi6e^x\\sin\\frac{\\pi e^x}{6},\\qquad y&#x27;(0)=-\\frac\\pi6\\sin\\frac\\pi6=-\\frac\\pi{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(0.1)-y(0)\\approx y&#x27;(0)\\Delta x</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.8398</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.84</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(0.1)\\approx y(0)+y&#x27;(0)\\Delta x=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}-\\frac\\pi{12}\\cdot0.1\\approx0.8398\\approx0.84</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
