   "questionHtml": "נתונה הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם פרמטר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2x-a}-\\sqrt x}{x^2-a^2},&amp;x\\ne a\\\\[2mm]\\sqrt a,&amp;x=a\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. עבור איזה ערך של פרמטר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span> הפונקציה רציפה בנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=a</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to a}\\frac{\\sqrt{2x-a}-\\sqrt x}{x^2-a^2}=\\lim_{x\\to a}\\frac{2x-a-x}{(x-a)(x+a)\\left(\\sqrt{2x-a}+\\sqrt x\\right)}=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\lim_{x\\to a}\\frac{x-a}{(x-a)(x+a)\\left(\\sqrt{2x-a}+\\sqrt x\\right)}=\\lim_{x\\to a}\\frac1{(x+a)\\left(\\sqrt{2x-a}+\\sqrt x\\right)}=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac1{4a\\sqrt a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>הפונקציה רציפה בנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=a</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר הגבול שווה לערך הפונקציה בנקודה:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac1{4a\\sqrt a}=\\sqrt a,\\quad4a^2=1,\\quad a=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
