   "year": 2017,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "מקסימום ומינימום",
   "questionHtml": "מצאו מינימום ומקסימום מוחלטים של הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mroot><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x\\cdot\\sqrt[3]{(3x-12)^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> בקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,6]</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mroot><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mroot><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=\\sqrt[3]{(3x-12)^2}+\\frac23x\\frac{3}{\\sqrt[3]{3x-12}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mroot><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mroot><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=\\frac{3x-12+2x}{\\sqrt[3]{3x-12}}=\\frac{5x-12}{\\sqrt[3]{3x-12}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>תחום הגדרה של הנגזרת: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ne4</annotation></semantics></math></span>. בנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=4</annotation></semantics></math></span> הפונקציה מוגדרת, לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=4</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא נקודה חשודה.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=0\\ \\Rightarrow\\ x=2.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2.4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≅</mo><mn>6.829</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≅</mo><mn>19.81</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(0)=0,\\qquad y(2.4)\\cong6.829,\\quad y(4)=0,\\quad y(6)\\cong19.81</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mroot><mn>36</mn><mn>3</mn></mroot><mo>≅</mo><mn>19.81</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{max}=y(6)=6\\cdot\\sqrt[3]{36}\\cong19.81</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{min}=y(0)=y(4)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
