   "questionHtml": "חשבו שטח הכלוא בין גרפים של פונקציות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x^3</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>32</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\sqrt{32x}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נקודות חיתוך בין הקווים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>32</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>32</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3em\" maxsize=\"3em\">∣</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>6.67</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=\\int_0^2\\left(\\sqrt{32x}-x^3\\right)dx=\\left(\\sqrt{32}\\cdot\\frac{2\\sqrt{x^3}}{3}-\\frac{x^4}{4}\\right)\\Bigg|_0^2=\\frac{32}{3}-4\\approx6.67</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
