   "question": "הוכיחו כי $\\frac{x-1}{x}<\\ln x<x-1$ לכל $x>1$.",
   "solution": "נגדיר $f(x)=\\ln x$ על $[1,x]$. הפונקציה $f$ רציפה ב-$[1,x]$ וגזירה ב-$(1,x)$, $f'(x)=\\frac1x$, ולכן לפי משפט לגרנז' $f(x)-f(1)=f'(c)(x-1)$ עבור $1<c<x$, כלומר\n$$\\ln x-\\ln1=\\frac1c(x-1),\\qquad1<c<x$$\n$$\\ln x=\\frac1c(x-1)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\frac{x-1}{x}<\\ln x<x-1$$\n(כי $\\frac1x<\\frac1c<1$.)",
   "solutionSource": "student-solution",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "high",
   "part": "א",
   "points": 10,
   "id": "17B-A-Q4a",
   "partKey": "a",
   "examCode": "17B-A",
   "examLabel": "מבחן סוף סמסטר א' תשע\"ז, מועד ב'",
   "year": 2017,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "משפטי ערך הביניים והממוצע",
   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{x-1}{x}&lt;\\ln x&lt;x-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נגדיר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\ln x</annotation></semantics></math></span> על <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1,x]</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> רציפה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1,x]</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגזירה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,x)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)=\\frac1x</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן לפי משפט לגרנז' <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)-f(1)=f&#x27;(c)(x-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1&lt;c&lt;x</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln x-\\ln1=\\frac1c(x-1),\\qquad1&lt;c&lt;x</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln x=\\frac1c(x-1)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\frac{x-1}{x}&lt;\\ln x&lt;x-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>(כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac1x&lt;\\frac1c&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.)",
   "pointsTotal": 10
