   "year": 2017,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "רציפות",
   "questionHtml": "עבור אילו ערכים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a,b</annotation></semantics></math></span> תהיה הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\begin{cases}x^{-2}\\left(e^{ax}-1\\right)^2,&amp;x&lt;0\\\\[1mm]b,&amp;x=0\\\\[1mm]4+e^{-a^2/x},&amp;x&gt;0\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span> רציפה בנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to0^-}f(x)=\\lim_{x\\to0^-}\\left(\\frac{e^{ax}-1}{x}\\right)^2=\\lim_{x\\to0^-}\\left(a\\cdot\\frac{e^{ax}-1}{ax}\\right)^2=a^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to0^+}f(x)=\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\left(4+e^{-\\frac{a^2}{x}}\\right)=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^2=b=4</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר הפונקציה רציפה אם ורק אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=4</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=\\pm2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
