   "examLabel": "מבחן סוף סמסטר א' תשע\"ח, מועד ב'",
   "year": 2018,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "מקסימום ומינימום",
   "questionHtml": "מצאו את כל ערכי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span> שבהם לפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>t</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>5</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\int_{-3}^{x^3+1}t\\cdot(t-1)^5\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span> יש קיצון מקומי.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>5</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\int_{-3}^{x^3+1}t(t-1)^5\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>תחום ההגדרה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-\\infty,\\infty)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לפי משפט היסוד של החשבון האינטגרלי וכלל השרשרת:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>5</mn></msup><msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>17</mn></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)=t(t-1)^5\\Big|_{t=x^3+1}\\cdot3x^2=\\left(x^3+1\\right)\\left(x^3\\right)^5\\cdot3x^2=3x^{17}\\left(x^3+1\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>17</mn></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3x^{17}\\left(x^3+1\\right)=0\\ \\Rightarrow\\ x_1=0,\\quad x_2=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>טבלת סימנים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span>: חיובית ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&lt;-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> (עולה), שלילית ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1&lt;x&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span> (יורדת), חיובית ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span> (עולה).<br>לכן ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> יש קיצון מקומי ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> (מקסימום) וב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math></span> (מינימום).",
