   "examLabel": "מבחן סוף סמסטר א' תשע\"ח, מועד ב'",
   "year": 2018,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "משפטי ערך הביניים והממוצע",
   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו את אי-השוויון <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3e&lt;\\frac{be^{b^2}-ae^{a^2}}{b-a}&lt;9e^4</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1&lt;a&lt;b&lt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נגדיר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=xe^{x^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הפונקציה רציפה על <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[a,b]</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגזירה על <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a,b)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן לפי משפט לגרנז' קיימת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\in(a,b)</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}=f&#x27;(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)=e^{x^2}+x\\cdot e^{x^2}\\cdot2x=e^{x^2}\\left(1+2x^2\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{be^{b^2}-ae^{a^2}}{b-a}=e^{c^2}\\left(1+2c^2\\right),\\qquad1&lt;a&lt;c&lt;b&lt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)=e^{x^2}\\left(1+2x^2\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> עולה ממש עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span> (מכפלה של שתי פונקציות חיוביות עולות), ולכן מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1&lt;c&lt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span> נקבל<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3e=f&#x27;(1)&lt;e^{c^2}\\left(1+2c^2\\right)&lt;f&#x27;(2)=9e^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3e&lt;\\frac{be^{b^2}-ae^{a^2}}{b-a}&lt;9e^4</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
