   "question": "חשבו את האינטגרל: $\\int\\frac{\\sin^3x}{\\cos^4x}\\,dx$.",
   "solution": "$$\\int\\frac{\\sin^3x}{\\cos^4x}dx=\\left|\\begin{matrix}t=\\cos x\\\\dt=-\\sin x\\,dx\\end{matrix}\\right|=\\int\\frac{\\sin^2x\\cdot\\sin x\\,dx}{\\cos^4x}=-\\int\\frac{1-t^2}{t^4}dt=\\frac{1}{3t^3}-\\frac1t+C=\\frac{1}{3\\cos^3x}-\\frac{1}{\\cos x}+C$$",
