   "topicLabel": "משפטי ערך הביניים והממוצע",
   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו את אי-השוויון הבא: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le\\frac{b\\ln b-a\\ln a}{b-a}\\le2</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le a&lt;b\\le e</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=x\\ln x</annotation></semantics></math></span> רציפה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[a,b]</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגזירה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a,b)</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le a&lt;b\\le e</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לפי משפט לגרנז' קיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\in(a,b)</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(c)=\\frac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)=(x\\ln x)&#x27;=\\ln x+1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln c+1=\\frac{b\\ln b-a\\ln a}{b-a}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>פונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln x+1</annotation></semantics></math></span> מונוטונית עולה ממש ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1,e]</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1=\\ln1+1\\le\\ln a+1&lt;\\ln c+1&lt;\\ln b+1\\le\\ln e+1=2,</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>ז\"א <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le\\frac{b\\ln b-a\\ln a}{b-a}\\le2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
