   "question": "חשבו את האינטגרל הבא: $\\int\\frac{\\tan x}{\\cos^2x\\cdot e^{2\\tan x}}\\,dx$.",
   "solution": "$$\\int\\frac{\\tan x}{\\cos^2x\\cdot e^{2\\tan x}}dx=\\left|t=\\tan x,\\ dt=\\frac{1}{\\cos^2x}dx\\right|=\\int te^{-2t}dt=\\left|u=t,\\ v'=e^{-2t}\\Rightarrow u'=1,\\ v=-\\frac12e^{-2t}\\right|=$$\n$$=-\\frac12te^{-2t}+\\frac12\\int e^{-2t}dt=-\\frac12te^{-2t}-\\frac14e^{-2t}+C=-\\frac12\\tan x\\,e^{-2\\tan x}-\\frac14e^{-2\\tan x}+C=-\\frac{2\\tan x+1}{4e^{2\\tan x}}+C$$",
   "solutionSource": "official-pdf",
