   "questionHtml": "מצאו את משוואת המשיק לגרף של הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=(x-3)^{\\sqrt{x}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> בנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=4</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)=\\left((x-3)^{\\sqrt x}\\right)&#x27;=\\left(e^{\\sqrt x\\ln(x-3)}\\right)&#x27;=(x-3)^{\\sqrt x}\\left(\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt x}\\ln(x-3)+\\frac{\\sqrt x}{x-3}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn></msqrt></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>4</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(4)=(4-3)^{\\sqrt4}\\left(\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt4}\\ln(4-3)+\\frac{\\sqrt4}{4-3}\\right)=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn></msqrt></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(4)=(4-3)^{\\sqrt4}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>משוואת המשיק לגרף של הפונקציה היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1+2(x-4)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
