   "question": "חשבו את האינטגרל $\\int\\frac{2x^2-x+1}{(x-1)\\left(x^2+1\\right)}\\,dx$.",
   "solution": "$$\\frac{2x^2-x+1}{(x-1)\\left(x^2+1\\right)}=\\frac{A}{x-1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+1}=\\frac{A\\left(x^2+1\\right)+(Bx+C)(x-1)}{(x-1)\\left(x^2+1\\right)}$$\n$$2x^2-x+1=(A+B)x^2+(-B+C)x+(A-C)$$\n$$A=1,\\ B=1,\\ C=0$$\n$$\\int\\frac{2x^2-x+1}{(x-1)\\left(x^2+1\\right)}dx=\\int\\left(\\frac{1}{x-1}+\\frac{x}{x^2+1}\\right)dx=\\ln|x-1|+\\frac12\\ln\\left(x^2+1\\right)+C$$",
