   "questionHtml": "חשבו את האינטגרל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{2x^2-x+1}{(x-1)\\left(x^2+1\\right)}\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
