   "topic": "function_limits",
   "question": "חשבו את הגבול הבא: $\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(1+e^x\\right)^{\\frac{1}{x}}$.",
   "solution": "$$\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(1+e^x\\right)^{\\frac1x}=\\left[\\infty^0\\right]=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}e^{\\frac1x\\ln\\left(1+e^x\\right)}$$\n$$\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac1x\\ln\\left(1+e^x\\right)=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\ln\\left(1+e^x\\right)}{x}=\\left[\\frac{\\infty}{\\infty}\\right]=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\left(\\ln\\left(1+e^x\\right)\\right)'}{(x)'}=$$\n$$=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\frac{e^x}{1+e^x}}{1}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{e^x}{1+e^x}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{1}{e^{-x}+1}=\\frac{1}{0+1}=1$$\n$$\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(1+e^x\\right)^{\\frac1x}=e^1=e$$",
