   "questionHtml": "מצאו את משוואת המשיק לגרף של הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\ln\\left(1+x^2\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> המקביל לישר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-y=7</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=1\\cdot x-7\\ \\Rightarrow\\ f&#x27;(x_0)=1\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\frac{2x_0}{1+x_0^2}=1\\ \\Rightarrow\\ x_0=1,\\quad f(1)=\\ln2</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=f(1)+f&#x27;(1)(x-1)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=\\ln2+(x-1)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ y=x+(\\ln2-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>משוואת המשיק לגרף של הפונקציה היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x+(\\ln2-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
