   "question": "חשבו את הגבול $\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{2+2x+x^2}-\\sqrt{2-2x+x^2}\\right)$.",
   "solution": "$$\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{2+2x+x^2}-\\sqrt{2-2x+x^2}\\right)=\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac{2+2x+x^2-2+2x-x^2}{\\sqrt{2+2x+x^2}+\\sqrt{2-2x+x^2}}=$$\n$$=\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac{4x}{\\sqrt{2+2x+x^2}+\\sqrt{2-2x+x^2}}=\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac{4x}{|x|\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{x^2}+\\frac2x+1}+\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{x^2}-\\frac2x+1}\\right)}=$$\n$$=\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac{4}{-\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{x^2}+\\frac2x+1}+\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{x^2}-\\frac2x+1}\\right)}=\\frac{4}{-\\left(\\sqrt1+\\sqrt1\\right)}=-2$$",
