   "question": "חשבו את הגבול הבא: $\\lim_{x\\to0}(\\cos x)^{\\frac{1}{\\sin^2(2x)}}$.",
   "solution": "$$\\lim_{x\\to0}(\\cos x)^{\\frac{1}{\\sin^2(2x)}}=\\{1^{\\infty}\\}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(1+\\cos x-1\\right)^{\\frac{1}{\\sin^2(2x)}}=$$\n$$=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(1+\\cos x-1\\right)^{\\frac{1}{\\cos x-1}\\cdot\\frac{\\cos x-1}{\\sin^2(2x)}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(1+\\cos x-1\\right)^{\\frac{1}{\\cos x-1}\\cdot\\frac{-2\\sin^2\\frac{x}{2}}{\\sin^2(2x)}}=e^{\\frac{-2\\cdot\\frac14}{4}}=e^{-\\frac18}$$",
