   "topicLabel": "רציפות",
   "questionHtml": "עבור איזה ערך של הפרמטר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span> הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2-x}-1}-\\sqrt{2-x}, &amp; x\\le0\\\\[2mm] \\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+ax}-\\cos x}{x}, &amp; x&gt;0\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span> רציפה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
   "solutionHtml": "נמצא את הגבולות החד-צדדיים:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to0^-}f(x)=\\lim_{x\\to0^-}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2-x}-1}-\\sqrt{2-x}\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2-1}-\\sqrt2=\\frac{1-\\sqrt2\\left(\\sqrt2-1\\right)}{\\sqrt2-1}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to0^+}f(x)=\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{\\sqrt{1+ax}-1+1-\\cos x}{x}=\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{1+ax}-1}{x}+\\frac{2\\sin^2\\frac{x}{2}}{x}\\right)=\\frac12a+0=\\frac{a}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>הפונקציה תהיה רציפה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math></span> אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{a}{2}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
