   "topic": "definite_integrals",
   "question": "חשבו את אורך הקשת של העקומה $y=\\cosh x$ בתחום $-2\\le x\\le2$. ניזכר: $\\cosh x=\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}{2}$.",
   "solution": "נמצא את אורך הקשת לפי הנוסחה: $l=\\int_{-2}^{2}\\sqrt{1+(y')^2}\\,dx$.\n$$y'=\\frac{e^x-e^{-x}}{2},$$\n$$1+(y')^2=1+\\left(\\frac{e^x-e^{-x}}{2}\\right)^2=1+\\frac{e^{2x}-2+e^{-2x}}{4}=\\frac{e^{2x}+2+e^{-2x}}{4}=\\left(\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}{2}\\right)^2,$$\n$$l=\\int_{-2}^{2}\\sqrt{1+(y')^2}\\,dx=\\int_{-2}^{2}\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}{2}\\,dx=2\\int_{0}^{2}\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}{2}\\,dx=\\left(e^x-e^{-x}\\right)\\Big|_0^2=e^2-e^{-2}$$",
   "solutionSource": "official-pdf",
   "official": true,
   "confidence": "high",
   "part": "ב",
   "points": 10,
   "id": "20A-A-Q4b",
   "partKey": "b",
   "examCode": "20A-A",
   "examLabel": "מבחן סוף סמסטר א' תש\"פ, מועד א'",
   "year": 2020,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "אינטגרל מסוים",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את אורך הקשת של העקומה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cosh</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\cosh x</annotation></semantics></math></span> בתחום <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2\\le x\\le2</annotation></semantics></math></span>. ניזכר: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cosh</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cosh x=\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נמצא את אורך הקשת לפי הנוסחה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l=\\int_{-2}^{2}\\sqrt{1+(y&#x27;)^2}\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=\\frac{e^x-e^{-x}}{2},</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+(y&#x27;)^2=1+\\left(\\frac{e^x-e^{-x}}{2}\\right)^2=1+\\frac{e^{2x}-2+e^{-2x}}{4}=\\frac{e^{2x}+2+e^{-2x}}{4}=\\left(\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}{2}\\right)^2,</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l=\\int_{-2}^{2}\\sqrt{1+(y&#x27;)^2}\\,dx=\\int_{-2}^{2}\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}{2}\\,dx=2\\int_{0}^{2}\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}{2}\\,dx=\\left(e^x-e^{-x}\\right)\\Big|_0^2=e^2-e^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
