   "topicLabel": "נגזרות ומשיקים",
   "questionHtml": "נתון כי פונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span> רציפה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=a</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(a)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הוכיחו כי פונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=|x-a|\\,g(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span> גזירה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=a</annotation></semantics></math></span> ומצאו את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נבדוק את הגזירות של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> לפי ההגדרה:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(a)=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\frac{f(a+\\Delta x)-f(a)}{\\Delta x}=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\frac{|a+\\Delta x-a|\\,g(a+\\Delta x)-|a-a|\\,g(a)}{\\Delta x}=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\frac{|\\Delta x|\\,g(a+\\Delta x)}{\\Delta x}=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\frac{|\\Delta x|}{\\Delta x}\\,g(a+\\Delta x)=0,</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>כי הביטוי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{|\\Delta x|}{\\Delta x}</annotation></semantics></math></span> חסום <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1\\le\\frac{|\\Delta x|}{\\Delta x}\\le1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(a+\\Delta x)</annotation></semantics></math></span> שואף ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span> רציפה.",
