   "solutionHtml": "נמצא את נפח הגוף לפי שיטת הפרוסות כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\le x\\le3</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\pi\\int_2^3(x-2)e^{-x}dx=\\begin{vmatrix}u=x-2&amp;du=dx\\\\dv=e^{-x}dx&amp;v=-e^{-x}\\end{vmatrix}=\\pi\\left(-(x-2)e^{-x}\\Big|_2^3+\\int_2^3e^{-x}dx\\right)=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\pi\\left(-e^{-3}-e^{-x}\\Big|_2^3\\right)=\\pi\\left(e^{-2}-2e^{-3}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
