   "questionHtml": "מצאו עבור אילו פרמטרים ממשיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a,b</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקיים השוויון: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left[x\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+x+a}-\\sqrt{x^2-bx}\\right)\\right]=3</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left[x\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+x+a}-\\sqrt{x^2-bx}\\right)\\right]=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}x\\,\\frac{x^2+x+a-(x^2-bx)}{\\sqrt{x^2+x+a}+\\sqrt{x^2-bx}}=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{(1+b)x^2+ax}{\\sqrt{x^2+x+a}+\\sqrt{x^2-bx}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>החזקה הגבוהה ביותר במונה היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b\\neq-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> והחזקה של המכנה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן הגבול קיים רק עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ואז<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{ax}{\\sqrt{x^2+x+a}+\\sqrt{x^2+x}}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{a}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{a}{x^2}}+\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{x}}}=\\frac{a}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>השוויון מתקיים רק כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=6,\\ b=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
