   "question": "חשבו את אורך הקשת של העקומה $y=\\frac{2}{5}x\\sqrt[4]{x}-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt[4]{x^3}$ בתחום $0\\le x\\le1$.",
   "solution": "לפי הנוסחה: $L=\\int_0^1\\sqrt{1+(y')^2}\\,dx$, אז נמצא את הנגזרת של הפונקציה:\n$$y'=\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot\\frac{5}{4}x^{\\frac14}-\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}x^{-\\frac14}=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(x^{\\frac14}-x^{-\\frac14}\\right),$$\n$$1+(y')^2=1+\\frac{x^{\\frac12}-2+x^{-\\frac12}}{4}=\\frac{x^{\\frac12}+2+x^{-\\frac12}}{4}=\\left(\\frac{x^{\\frac14}+x^{-\\frac14}}{2}\\right)^2,$$\n$$L=\\int_0^1\\sqrt{1+(y')^2}\\,dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_0^1\\left(x^{\\frac14}+x^{-\\frac14}\\right)dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{4}{5}x^{\\frac54}+\\frac{4}{3}x^{\\frac34}\\right)\\Big|_0^1=\\frac{2}{5}+\\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{16}{15}$$",
   "solutionSource": "official-pdf",
   "official": true,
   "confidence": "high",
   "part": "ב",
