   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "אינטגרל מסוים",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את השטח של התחום הנמצא בין גרף הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\frac{\\ln(x+1)}{\\sqrt{x+1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> לבין ציר ה-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span> בקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נציין כי בקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span> הפונקציה מקבלת ערכים לא שליליים כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln(x+1)\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{x+1}\\ge1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, לכן<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=\\int_0^1\\frac{\\ln(x+1)}{\\sqrt{x+1}}\\,dx.</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>לפי אינטגרציה בחלקים נקבל, עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=\\ln(x+1),\\ dv=\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x+1}},\\ du=\\frac{dx}{x+1},\\ v=2\\sqrt{x+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=2\\sqrt{x+1}\\ln(x+1)\\Big|_0^1-2\\int_0^1\\frac{\\sqrt{x+1}}{x+1}\\,dx=2\\sqrt{2}\\ln2-2\\int_0^1\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x+1}}=2\\sqrt{2}\\ln2-4\\sqrt{x+1}\\Big|_0^1=2\\sqrt{2}\\ln2-4\\sqrt{2}+4</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
