   "topic": "sequences_limits",
   "question": "חשבו את גבול הסדרה $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{3^n}{3^n+b^n}$, כאשר $b>0$ הוא פרמטר ממשי.",
   "solution": "נבחין בשלושה מקרים:\n**$0<b<3$:** נחלק ב-$3^n$: $\\frac{3^n}{3^n+b^n}=\\frac{1}{1+\\left(\\frac{b}{3}\\right)^n}\\to\\frac{1}{1+0}=1$, כי $0<\\frac{b}{3}<1$.\n**$b=3$:** $\\frac{3^n}{3^n+3^n}=\\frac{1}{2}$ לכל $n$, והגבול $\\frac{1}{2}$.\n**$b>3$:** נחלק ב-$b^n$: $\\frac{3^n}{3^n+b^n}=\\frac{\\left(\\frac{3}{b}\\right)^n}{\\left(\\frac{3}{b}\\right)^n+1}\\to\\frac{0}{0+1}=0$, כי $0<\\frac{3}{b}<1$.\n$$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{3^n}{3^n+b^n}=\\begin{cases}1, & 0<b<3\\\\ \\frac{1}{2}, & b=3\\\\ 0, & b>3\\end{cases}$$",
   "solutionSource": "solved",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "high",
   "part": "א",
   "points": 10,
   "id": "20B-C-Q2a",
   "partKey": "a",
   "examCode": "20B-C",
   "examLabel": "מבחן סוף סמסטר קיץ תש\"פ, מועד ב'",
   "year": 2020,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "סדרות וגבולות",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את גבול הסדרה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></msub><mfrac><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{3^n}{3^n+b^n}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא פרמטר ממשי.",
   "solutionHtml": "נבחין בשלושה מקרים:<br><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;b&lt;3</annotation></semantics></math></span>:</strong> נחלק ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>→</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3^n}{3^n+b^n}=\\frac{1}{1+\\left(\\frac{b}{3}\\right)^n}\\to\\frac{1}{1+0}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;\\frac{b}{3}&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=3</annotation></semantics></math></span>:</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3^n}{3^n+3^n}=\\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, והגבול <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b&gt;3</annotation></semantics></math></span>:</strong> נחלק ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mrow><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>→</mo><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3^n}{3^n+b^n}=\\frac{\\left(\\frac{3}{b}\\right)^n}{\\left(\\frac{3}{b}\\right)^n+1}\\to\\frac{0}{0+1}=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;\\frac{3}{b}&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{3^n}{3^n+b^n}=\\begin{cases}1, &amp; 0&lt;b&lt;3\\\\ \\frac{1}{2}, &amp; b=3\\\\ 0, &amp; b&gt;3\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
