   "topicLabel": "אינטגרל לא מסוים",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את האינטגרל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{x^3+2x+5}{x^2-1}\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "חילוק פולינומים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^3+2x+5=x\\left(x^2-1\\right)+3x+5</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{x^3+2x+5}{x^2-1}=x+\\frac{3x+5}{(x-1)(x+1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>פירוק לשברים חלקיים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3x+5}{(x-1)(x+1)}=\\frac{A}{x-1}+\\frac{B}{x+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3x+5=A(x+1)+B(x-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8=2A\\Rightarrow A=4</annotation></semantics></math></span>. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2=-2B\\Rightarrow B=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{x^3+2x+5}{x^2-1}\\,dx=\\int\\left(x+\\frac{4}{x-1}-\\frac{1}{x+1}\\right)dx=\\frac{x^2}{2}+4\\ln|x-1|-\\ln|x+1|+C</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
