   "question": "חשבו את האינטגרל $\\int\\ln^2 x\\,dx$.",
   "solution": "אינטגרציה בחלקים עם $u=\\ln^2x$, $dv=dx$: $du=\\frac{2\\ln x}{x}dx$, $v=x$.\n$$\\int\\ln^2x\\,dx=x\\ln^2x-2\\int\\ln x\\,dx$$\nושוב בחלקים ($u=\\ln x$, $dv=dx$): $\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-\\int x\\cdot\\frac{1}{x}dx=x\\ln x-x$. לכן\n$$\\int\\ln^2x\\,dx=x\\ln^2x-2x\\ln x+2x+C$$",
   "solutionSource": "solved",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "high",
   "part": "א",
   "points": 10,
   "id": "20B-C-Q4a",
   "partKey": "a",
   "examCode": "20B-C",
   "examLabel": "מבחן סוף סמסטר קיץ תש\"פ, מועד ב'",
   "year": 2020,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "אינטגרל לא מסוים",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את האינטגרל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\ln^2 x\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "אינטגרציה בחלקים עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=\\ln^2x</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dv=dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">du=\\frac{2\\ln x}{x}dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v=x</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>∫</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\ln^2x\\,dx=x\\ln^2x-2\\int\\ln x\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>ושוב בחלקים (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u=\\ln x</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dv=dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>): <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-\\int x\\cdot\\frac{1}{x}dx=x\\ln x-x</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\ln^2x\\,dx=x\\ln^2x-2x\\ln x+2x+C</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
   "pointsTotal": 10
