   "questionHtml": "חשבו את הגבול <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to2}\\frac{\\sqrt{3x-2}-\\sqrt{x+2}}{x^2-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "צורה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{0}{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. נכפיל בצמוד:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\sqrt{3x-2}-\\sqrt{x+2}}{x^2-4}=\\frac{(3x-2)-(x+2)}{(x-2)(x+2)\\left(\\sqrt{3x-2}+\\sqrt{x+2}\\right)}=\\frac{2(x-2)}{(x-2)(x+2)\\left(\\sqrt{3x-2}+\\sqrt{x+2}\\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to2}\\frac{\\sqrt{3x-2}-\\sqrt{x+2}}{x^2-4}=\\lim_{x\\to2}\\frac{2}{(x+2)\\left(\\sqrt{3x-2}+\\sqrt{x+2}\\right)}=\\frac{2}{4\\cdot(2+2)}=\\frac{1}{8}</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
