   "questionHtml": "חשבו את השטח הכלוא בין הקווים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=2x,\\quad y=\\frac{x}{2},\\quad y=\\frac{1}{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נקודות החיתוך ברביע הראשון: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x=\\frac{1}{x}\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> (הנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}},\\sqrt{2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>), ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{x}{2}=\\frac{1}{x}\\Rightarrow x=\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> (הנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(\\sqrt{2},\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>). שני הישרים נחתכים בראשית.<br>התחום חסום מלמטה על ידי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\frac{x}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ומלמעלה על ידי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=2x</annotation></semantics></math></span> (עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le x\\le\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>) ועל ידי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\frac{1}{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span> (עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\le x\\le\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>):<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=\\int_0^{1/\\sqrt{2}}\\left(2x-\\frac{x}{2}\\right)dx+\\int_{1/\\sqrt{2}}^{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{x}{2}\\right)dx=\\frac{3x^2}{4}\\Big|_0^{1/\\sqrt{2}}+\\left(\\ln x-\\frac{x^2}{4}\\right)\\Big|_{1/\\sqrt{2}}^{\\sqrt{2}}=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{3}{8}+\\left(\\ln\\sqrt{2}-\\ln\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{2}{4}-\\frac{1}{8}\\right)=\\frac{3}{8}+\\ln2-\\frac{3}{8}=\\ln2</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>הערה: ברביע השלישי יש תחום סימטרי (סימטריה ביחס לראשית) עם אותו שטח <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln2</annotation></semantics></math></span>; התשובה המקובלת לשאלה היא שטח התחום האחד, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
