   "question": "עבור אילו ערכים של $a$ ו-$b$ מתקיים: $\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\frac{x^3}{x^2-x+2}+ax+b\\right)=0$.",
   "solution": "$$\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\frac{x^3}{x^2-x+2}+ax+b\\right)=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\frac{x^3+ax^3-ax^2+2ax+bx^2-bx+2b}{x^2-x+2}\\right)=$$\n$$\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\frac{(a+1)x^3+(b-a)x^2+(2a-b)x+2b}{x^2-x+2}\\right)\\ \\{a=-1\\}\\ \\left[\\frac{\\infty}{\\infty}\\right]=$$\n$$=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\frac{(b-a)+\\frac{2a-b}{x}+\\frac{2b}{x^2}}{1-\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{2}{x^2}}\\right)=0$$\nלכן $a=b=-1$",
