   "question": "חשבו את הגבול הבא: $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sqrt{1+\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}-\\sqrt{1-\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}}{x}$.",
   "solution": "$$\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sqrt{1+\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}-\\sqrt{1-\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}}{x}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\left(\\sqrt{1+\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}-\\sqrt{1-\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{1+\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}+\\sqrt{1-\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}\\right)}{x\\left(\\sqrt{1+\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}+\\sqrt{1-\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}\\right)}=$$\n$$=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{2\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}{x\\left(\\sqrt{1+\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}+\\sqrt{1-\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}\\right)}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}{\\frac{x}{2}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}+\\sqrt{1-\\sin\\frac{x}{2}}}=\\frac{1}{2}$$",
