   "question": "חשבו את הגבול $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\ln\\cos x}{\\ln\\cos4x}$.",
   "solution": "$$\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\ln\\cos x}{\\ln\\cos4x}=\\left(\\frac{0}{0}\\right)=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\frac{-\\sin x}{\\cos x}}{\\frac{-4\\sin4x}{\\cos4x}}=\\frac{1}{4}\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\tan x}{\\tan4x}=\\left(\\frac{0}{0}\\right)=$$\n$$=\\frac{1}{4}\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\frac{1}{\\cos^2x}}{\\frac{4}{\\cos^24x}}=\\frac{1}{4}\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\cos^24x}{4\\cos^2x}=\\frac{1}{16}$$",
