   "topicLabel": "מקסימום ומינימום",
   "questionHtml": "מצאו את הערך הגדול ביותר ואת הערך הקטן ביותר של הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mroot><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mn>5</mn></mroot><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\frac{4}{5}x-\\sqrt[5]{(x-1)^4}+2</annotation></semantics></math></span> בקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,3]</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "תחום הגדרה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(f)=(-\\infty,\\infty)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mroot><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mroot></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mroot><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mroot><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mroot><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mroot></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)=\\frac{4}{5}-\\frac{4}{5}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt[5]{x-1}}=\\frac{4}{5}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt[5]{x-1}-1}{\\sqrt[5]{x-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mroot><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mroot><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt[5]{x-1}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>. בנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> הנגזרת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span> אינה קיימת.<br>הנקודות החשודות בקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,3]</annotation></semantics></math></span> הן: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,\\ 2,\\ 0,\\ 3</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>14</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>22</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mroot><mn>16</mn><mn>5</mn></mroot><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.66</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0)=1,\\quad f(1)=\\frac{14}{5},\\quad f(2)=\\frac{13}{5},\\quad f(3)=\\frac{22}{5}-\\sqrt[5]{16}\\approx 2.66</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>14</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{[0,3]}f=f(1)=\\frac{14}{5},\\qquad \\min_{[0,3]}f=f(0)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
   "pointsTotal": 10
