   "questionHtml": "חשבו את הגבול <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{n^2+C+1}-n\\right)\\sin\\left(2^{(B+1)n}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{n^2+C+1}-n\\right)\\sin\\left(2^{(B+1)n}\\right)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{n^2+C+1-n^2}{\\sqrt{n^2+C+1}+n}\\cdot\\sin\\left(2^{(B+1)n}\\right)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1\\le\\sin\\left(2^{(B+1)n}\\right)\\le 1</annotation></semantics></math></span> (סדרה חסומה), והסדרה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{C+1}{\\sqrt{n^2+C+1}+n}</annotation></semantics></math></span> שואפת ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
