   "question": "חשבו את האינטגרל $\\int x\\arctan\\left(x^2\\right)dx$.",
   "solution": "$$\\int x\\arctan\\left(x^2\\right)dx=\\left|\\begin{array}{l}t=x^2\\\\ dt=2x\\,dx\\end{array}\\right|=\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\arctan t\\,dt=$$\n$$=\\left|\\begin{array}{ll}u=\\arctan t & du=\\frac{dt}{1+t^2}\\\\ dv=dt & v=t\\end{array}\\right|=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(t\\arctan t-\\int\\frac{t\\,dt}{1+t^2}\\right)=$$\n$$=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(t\\arctan t-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln\\left(1+t^2\\right)\\right)+c=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(x^2\\arctan\\left(x^2\\right)-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln\\left(1+x^4\\right)\\right)+c$$",
