   "questionHtml": "מצאו משיק משותף לשני הגרפים של הפונקציות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=2(A+1)\\ln x+C</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=(A+1)\\left(x^2-1\\right)+C</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "עבור הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=2(A+1)\\ln x+C</annotation></semantics></math></span> נקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=\\frac{2(A+1)}{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>ועבור הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=(A+1)\\left(x^2-1\\right)+C</annotation></semantics></math></span> נקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=2(A+1)x</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>מכאן נקבל שהנגזרות שוות כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2(A+1)}{x}=2(A+1)x</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מכיוון שתחום ההגדרה של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln x</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, מתקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>שתי הפונקציות נחתכות ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> כי בנקודה זו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=C</annotation></semantics></math></span> בשתיהן, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא נקודת ההשקה והשיפוע המשותף הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2(A+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. משוואת המשיק:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y-C=2(A+1)(x-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=2(A+1)x-2A+C-2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
