   "questionHtml": "חשבו את האינטגרל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{3x^3+x^2+4x+8}{x^4+4x^2}\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3x^3+x^2+4x+8}{x^2\\left(x^2+4\\right)}=\\frac{A}{x^2}+\\frac{B}{x}+\\frac{Cx+D}{x^2+4}=\\frac{A\\left(x^2+4\\right)+Bx\\left(x^2+4\\right)+(Cx+D)x^2}{x^2\\left(x^2+4\\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>נמצא את המקדמים מהשוואת הפולינומים (כאן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A,B,C,D</annotation></semantics></math></span> הם מקדמי הפירוק ולא הפרמטרים של המבחן):<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center left\" columnlines=\"solid\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>x</mi></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mtext> </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{array}{c|l}x^3 &amp; B+C=3\\\\ x^2 &amp; A+D=1\\\\ x &amp; 4B=4\\\\ 1 &amp; 4A=8\\end{array}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A=2,\\ B=1,\\ C=2,\\ D=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{3x^3+x^2+4x+8}{x^2\\left(x^2+4\\right)}dx=\\int\\left(\\frac{2}{x^2}+\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{2x-1}{x^2+4}\\right)dx=\\int\\left(\\frac{2}{x^2}+\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{2x}{x^2+4}-\\frac{1}{x^2+4}\\right)dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=-\\frac{2}{x}+\\ln|x|+\\ln\\left(x^2+4\\right)-\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan\\frac{x}{2}+c</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
   "pointsTotal": 10
