   "question": "הוכיחו את האי-שוויון: $\\arcsin x\\le\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$ עבור כל $x\\in[0,1)$.",
   "solution": "נגדיר $f(x)=\\arcsin x-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$. אז\n$$f'(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-x^2}-x\\cdot\\frac{-x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}}{1-x^2}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}-\\frac{x^2}{\\sqrt{\\left(1-x^2\\right)^3}}\\le 0$$\nלכן $f$ יורדת. מכיוון ש-$f(0)=0$ נקבל עבור $x\\in[0,1)$ כי $f(x)\\le 0$, כלומר\n$$\\arcsin x\\le\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$$",
   "solutionSource": "official-pdf",
   "official": true,
   "confidence": "high",
   "part": "א",
   "points": 10,
   "id": "22A-A-Q5a",
   "partKey": "a",
   "examCode": "22A-A",
   "examLabel": "מבחן סוף סמסטר א' תשפ\"ב, מועד א'",
   "year": 2022,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "משפטי ערך הביניים והממוצע",
   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו את האי-שוויון: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arcsin x\\le\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבור כל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in[0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נגדיר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\arcsin x-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. אז<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-x^2}-x\\cdot\\frac{-x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}}{1-x^2}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}-\\frac{x^2}{\\sqrt{\\left(1-x^2\\right)^3}}\\le 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> יורדת. מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span> נקבל עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in[0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)\\le 0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arcsin x\\le\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
