   "question": "חשבו את שטח התחום הכלוא בין הקווים: $y=\\frac{(A+2)x^2}{2}+B$ ו-$y=\\frac{A+2}{1+x^2}+B$.",
   "solution": "נמצא את נקודות החיתוך של שני הגרפים:\n$$\\frac{A+2}{1+x^2}+B=\\frac{(A+2)x^2}{2}+B\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\frac{1}{1+x^2}=\\frac{x^2}{2}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ x^4+x^2-2=0$$\nנסמן $t=x^2\\ge 0$: $t^2+t-2=0$, ולכן $t=-2$ (לא מתקבל, כי $t\\ge 0$) או $t=1$. מכאן $x=\\pm 1$.\n![שרטוט שני הגרפים והתחום הכלוא ביניהם](images/exams/22A-A-Q5b-sketch.png)\n$$S=2\\int_0^1\\left(\\frac{A+2}{1+x^2}+B-\\left(\\frac{(A+2)x^2}{2}+B\\right)\\right)dx=2(A+2)\\int_0^1\\left(\\frac{1}{1+x^2}-\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right)dx=2(A+2)\\left(\\arctan x-\\frac{x^3}{6}\\right)\\Big|_0^1$$\n$$=2(A+2)\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\frac{1}{6}\\right)$$",
   "solutionSource": "official-pdf",
   "official": true,
   "confidence": "high",
   "part": "ב",
   "points": 10,
   "contextId": "22A-A-c0",
   "id": "22A-A-Q5b",
   "partKey": "b",
   "examCode": "22A-A",
   "examLabel": "מבחן סוף סמסטר א' תשפ\"ב, מועד א'",
   "year": 2022,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "אינטגרל מסוים",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את שטח התחום הכלוא בין הקווים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\frac{(A+2)x^2}{2}+B</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\frac{A+2}{1+x^2}+B</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נמצא את נקודות החיתוך של שני הגרפים:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{A+2}{1+x^2}+B=\\frac{(A+2)x^2}{2}+B\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\frac{1}{1+x^2}=\\frac{x^2}{2}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ x^4+x^2-2=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>נסמן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=x^2\\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^2+t-2=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=-2</annotation></semantics></math></span> (לא מתקבל, כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t\\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span>) או <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מכאן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\pm 1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<figure class=\"rt-fig\"><img src=\"images/exams/22A-A-Q5b-sketch.png\" alt=\"שרטוט שני הגרפים והתחום הכלוא ביניהם\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>שרטוט שני הגרפים והתחום הכלוא ביניהם</figcaption></figure><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=2\\int_0^1\\left(\\frac{A+2}{1+x^2}+B-\\left(\\frac{(A+2)x^2}{2}+B\\right)\\right)dx=2(A+2)\\int_0^1\\left(\\frac{1}{1+x^2}-\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right)dx=2(A+2)\\left(\\arctan x-\\frac{x^3}{6}\\right)\\Big|_0^1</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2(A+2)\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\frac{1}{6}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
