   "question": "חשבו את הגבול: $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x-\\arcsin x}{\\int_0^x\\ln\\left(1+t^2\\right)dt}$.",
   "solution": "$$\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x-\\arcsin x}{\\int_0^x\\ln\\left(1+t^2\\right)dt}=\\left\\{\\tfrac{0}{0}\\right\\}\\overset{\\text{L'H}}{=}\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{1-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}}{\\ln\\left(1+x^2\\right)}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sqrt{1-x^2}-1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\,\\ln\\left(1+x^2\\right)}$$\n$$=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{1-x^2-1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\left(\\sqrt{1-x^2}+1\\right)\\ln\\left(1+x^2\\right)}=-\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x^2}{\\ln\\left(1+x^2\\right)}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\left(\\sqrt{1-x^2}+1\\right)}=-\\frac{1}{2}$$\n(כאשר $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x^2}{\\ln\\left(1+x^2\\right)}=1$.)",
