   "question": "חשבו את האינטגרל הבא: $\\int x\\arctan\\frac{2}{x}\\,dx$.",
   "solution": "$$\\int x\\arctan\\frac{2}{x}\\,dx=\\left\\{u=\\arctan\\frac{2}{x},\\ du=\\frac{-\\frac{2}{x^2}}{1+\\frac{4}{x^2}}dx,\\ dv=x\\,dx,\\ v=\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right\\}=$$\n$$=\\frac{x^2}{2}\\arctan\\frac{2}{x}+\\int\\frac{\\frac{2}{x^2}\\cdot\\frac{x^2}{2}}{1+\\frac{4}{x^2}}dx=\\frac{x^2}{2}\\arctan\\frac{2}{x}+\\int\\frac{x^2+4-4}{x^2+4}dx=$$\n$$=\\frac{x^2}{2}\\arctan\\frac{2}{x}+x-2\\arctan\\frac{x}{2}+c$$",
