   "topicLabel": "משפטי ערך הביניים והממוצע",
   "questionHtml": "הראו כי לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקיים האי-שוויון <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{x}{1+x^2}&lt;\\arctan x&lt;x</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "יהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(t)=\\arctan t</annotation></semantics></math></span> רציפה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,x]</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגזירה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,x)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g&#x27;(t)=\\frac{1}{1+t^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לפי משפט לגרנז' קיימת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\in(0,x)</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש-<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⟹</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arctan x-\\arctan0=\\frac{1}{1+c^2}\\cdot x\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\arctan x=\\frac{x}{1+c^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;c&lt;x</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1&lt;1+c^2&lt;1+x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{1+x^2}&lt;\\frac{1}{1+c^2}&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. נכפיל ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{x}{1+x^2}&lt;\\frac{x}{1+c^2}=\\arctan x&lt;x</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
