   "question": "חשבו את האינטגרל $\\int\\frac{dx}{1+\\sin x+3\\cos x}$.",
   "points": 10,
   "solution": "הצבה אוניברסלית $t=\\tan\\frac{x}{2}$: $\\sin x=\\frac{2t}{1+t^2}$, $\\cos x=\\frac{1-t^2}{1+t^2}$, $dx=\\frac{2\\,dt}{1+t^2}$.\n$$1+\\sin x+3\\cos x=\\frac{1+t^2+2t+3-3t^2}{1+t^2}=\\frac{2\\left(2+t-t^2\\right)}{1+t^2}=\\frac{2(2-t)(1+t)}{1+t^2}$$\n$$\\int\\frac{dx}{1+\\sin x+3\\cos x}=\\int\\frac{dt}{(2-t)(1+t)}=\\frac{1}{3}\\int\\left(\\frac{1}{2-t}+\\frac{1}{1+t}\\right)dt=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\ln|1+t|-\\ln|2-t|\\right)+C=$$\n$$=\\frac{1}{3}\\ln\\left|\\frac{1+\\tan\\frac{x}{2}}{2-\\tan\\frac{x}{2}}\\right|+C$$",
   "solutionSource": "solved",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "high",
   "part": "ב",
   "id": "22B-A-Q3b",
   "partKey": "b",
   "examCode": "22B-A",
   "examLabel": "מבחן סוף סמסטר א' תשפ\"ב, מועד ב'",
   "year": 2022,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "אינטגרל לא מסוים",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את האינטגרל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{dx}{1+\\sin x+3\\cos x}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "הצבה אוניברסלית <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=\\tan\\frac{x}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin x=\\frac{2t}{1+t^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos x=\\frac{1-t^2}{1+t^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx=\\frac{2\\,dt}{1+t^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+\\sin x+3\\cos x=\\frac{1+t^2+2t+3-3t^2}{1+t^2}=\\frac{2\\left(2+t-t^2\\right)}{1+t^2}=\\frac{2(2-t)(1+t)}{1+t^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{dx}{1+\\sin x+3\\cos x}=\\int\\frac{dt}{(2-t)(1+t)}=\\frac{1}{3}\\int\\left(\\frac{1}{2-t}+\\frac{1}{1+t}\\right)dt=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\ln|1+t|-\\ln|2-t|\\right)+C=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{1}{3}\\ln\\left|\\frac{1+\\tan\\frac{x}{2}}{2-\\tan\\frac{x}{2}}\\right|+C</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
