   "topicLabel": "אינטגרל לא מסוים",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את האינטגרל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{\\arctan^3\\left(\\sqrt{x}\\right)}{(x+1)\\sqrt{x}}\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "הצבה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=\\arctan\\sqrt{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span> (עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>): <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dt=\\frac{1}{1+x}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dx}{(x+1)\\sqrt{x}}=2\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{\\arctan^3\\left(\\sqrt{x}\\right)}{(x+1)\\sqrt{x}}\\,dx=\\int t^3\\cdot2\\,dt=\\frac{t^4}{2}+C=\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan^4\\left(\\sqrt{x}\\right)+C</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
