   "questionHtml": "חשבו את הגבול: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(x^3+A\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+\\sqrt{x^4+C+1}}-x\\sqrt{2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "הפתרון כתוב באופן כללי עבור הפרמטרים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A,B,C\\in\\{0,1,\\dots,9\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>; במבחן מציבים אותם כבר בתחילת הפתרון.<br><br>נסמן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=C+1&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. נכפיל פעמיים בצמוד:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{x^2+\\sqrt{x^4+D}}-x\\sqrt{2}=\\frac{x^2+\\sqrt{x^4+D}-2x^2}{\\sqrt{x^2+\\sqrt{x^4+D}}+x\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{x^4+D}-x^2}{\\sqrt{x^2+\\sqrt{x^4+D}}+x\\sqrt{2}}=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{D}{\\left(\\sqrt{x^4+D}+x^2\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+\\sqrt{x^4+D}}+x\\sqrt{2}\\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>נחלק מונה ומכנה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^3</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>D</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>D</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\left(x^3+A\\right)D}{\\left(\\sqrt{x^4+D}+x^2\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+\\sqrt{x^4+D}}+x\\sqrt{2}\\right)}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\left(1+\\frac{A}{x^3}\\right)D}{\\left(\\sqrt{1+\\frac{D}{x^4}}+1\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{1+\\sqrt{1+\\frac{D}{x^4}}}+\\sqrt{2}\\right)}=\\frac{D}{2\\cdot2\\sqrt{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(x^3+A\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+\\sqrt{x^4+C+1}}-x\\sqrt{2}\\right)=\\frac{C+1}{4\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\,(C+1)}{8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>(הגבול אינו תלוי ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>.)",
