   "question": "חשבו את אורך הקשת של העקומה $y=\\ln(\\sin x)$ בקטע $\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{3},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$.",
   "points": 10,
   "solution": "$y'=\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}=\\cot x$, ולכן $1+(y')^2=1+\\cot^2x=\\frac{1}{\\sin^2x}$, ובקטע $\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{3},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$ מתקיים $\\sin x>0$:\n$$L=\\int_{\\pi/3}^{\\pi/2}\\frac{dx}{\\sin x}=\\ln\\left|\\tan\\frac{x}{2}\\right|\\Big|_{\\pi/3}^{\\pi/2}=\\ln\\tan\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\ln\\tan\\frac{\\pi}{6}=0-\\ln\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln3$$",
   "solutionSource": "solved",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "high",
   "part": "ב",
   "id": "22B-A-Q5b",
   "partKey": "b",
