   "topicLabel": "אינטגרל מסוים",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את אורך הקשת של העקומה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\ln(\\sin x)</annotation></semantics></math></span> בקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{3},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}=\\cot x</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+(y&#x27;)^2=1+\\cot^2x=\\frac{1}{\\sin^2x}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ובקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{3},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=\\int_{\\pi/3}^{\\pi/2}\\frac{dx}{\\sin x}=\\ln\\left|\\tan\\frac{x}{2}\\right|\\Big|_{\\pi/3}^{\\pi/2}=\\ln\\tan\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\ln\\tan\\frac{\\pi}{6}=0-\\ln\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln3</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
