   "questionHtml": "חשבו את אורך הקשת של העקומה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x\\sqrt{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span> בקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le x\\le1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=\\int_0^1\\sqrt{1+\\left(f&#x27;(x)\\right)^2}\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>⟹</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=x\\sqrt{x}=x^{3/2}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ f&#x27;(x)=\\frac{3}{2}x^{1/2}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\left(f&#x27;(x)\\right)^2=\\frac{9}{4}x\\ \\Longrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=\\int_0^1\\sqrt{1+\\frac{9}{4}x}\\,dx=\\frac{4}{9}\\int_0^1\\frac{9}{4}\\left(1+\\frac{9}{4}x\\right)^{1/2}dx=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{4}{9}\\cdot\\frac{2}{3}\\left(1+\\frac{9}{4}x\\right)^{3/2}\\Big|_0^1=\\frac{8}{27}\\left(\\left(\\frac{13}{4}\\right)^{3/2}-1\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
