   "questionHtml": "חשבו את האינטגרל הבא: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{dx}{(x+1)\\left(x^2+4x+5\\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נמצא את הפירוק מן הצורה:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{(x+1)\\left(x^2+4x+5\\right)}=\\frac{A}{x+1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+4x+5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1=A\\left(x^2+4x+5\\right)+(Bx+C)(x+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>נמצא את המקדמים:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=-1:\\ 1=2A\\Rightarrow A=\\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2:\\ A+B=0\\Rightarrow B=-\\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>4</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x:\\ 4A+B+C=0\\Rightarrow C=-\\frac{3}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{dx}{(x+1)\\left(x^2+4x+5\\right)}=\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{dx}{x+1}-\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{x\\,dx}{x^2+4x+5}-\\frac{3}{2}\\int\\frac{dx}{x^2+4x+5}=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln|x+1|-\\frac{1}{4}\\int\\frac{(2x+4-4)\\,dx}{x^2+4x+5}-\\frac{3}{2}\\int\\frac{dx}{x^2+4x+5}=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln|x+1|-\\frac{1}{4}\\int\\frac{(2x+4)\\,dx}{x^2+4x+5}-\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{dx}{(x+2)^2+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln|x+1|-\\frac{1}{4}\\ln\\left(x^2+4x+5\\right)-\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan(x+2)+C</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
