   "topicLabel": "אינטגרל לא מסוים",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את האינטגרל הבא: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{2x^2+x+4}{(x+1)(x^2+4)}\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "מנות פולינומים והדרגה במונה קטנה מהדרגה במכנה. לכן נפרק לסכום של מנות פולינומים:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2x^2+x+4}{(x+1)(x^2+4)}=\\frac{A}{x+1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(x^2+4)+(Bx+C)(x+1)=2x^2+x+4\\Rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>מכאן<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0\\Rightarrow4A+C=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=-1\\Rightarrow5A=5\\Rightarrow A=1\\Rightarrow C=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1\\Rightarrow5A+(B+C)\\cdot2=7\\Rightarrow5+2B=7\\Rightarrow B=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>לכן:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{2x^2+x+4}{(x+1)(x^2+4)}dx=\\int\\frac{1}{x+1}dx+\\int\\frac{x}{x^2+4}dx=\\ln|x+1|+\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(x^2+4)+C</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
