   "questionHtml": "חשבו את האינטגרל הבא: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{dx}{x\\cdot(\\ln^2x+2\\ln x+5)}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{dx}{x\\cdot(\\ln^2x+2\\ln x+5)}\\left\\{\\begin{matrix}t=\\ln x\\\\ dt=\\frac{dx}{x}\\end{matrix}\\right\\}=\\int\\frac{dt}{(t^2+2t+5)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\int\\frac{dt}{(t+1)^2+2^2}=\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan\\frac{(t+1)}{2}+C=\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan\\frac{(\\ln(x)+1)}{2}+C</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
