   "questionHtml": "חשבו את נפח גוף הסיבוב הנוצר מסיבוב של התחום המישורי הכלוא בין הקווים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\sqrt{x\\ln x},\\ y=0,\\ x=1,\\ x=e</annotation></semantics></math></span> סביב ציר ה-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נגדיר הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=f(x)=\\sqrt{x\\ln x}</annotation></semantics></math></span>; <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(1)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.177</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(2)\\approx1.177</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(e)\\approx1.64</annotation></semantics></math></span>. התחום הוא בין הגרף של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> לציר ה-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> בין <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=e</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>e</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>e</mi></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=\\pi\\int_1^ef^2(x)\\,dx=\\pi\\int_1^ex\\ln x\\,dx=\\left|\\begin{matrix}u=\\ln x &amp; du=\\frac{1}{x}dx\\\\ dv=x\\,dx &amp; v=\\frac{1}{2}x^2\\end{matrix}\\right|=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>e</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>e</mi></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>e</mi></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\pi\\left(\\frac{1}{2}x^2\\ln x\\Big|_1^e-\\frac{1}{2}\\int_1^ex\\,dx\\right)=\\pi\\left(\\frac{e^2}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{x^2}{2}\\Big|_1^e\\right)=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\pi\\left(\\frac{e^2}{2}-\\left(\\frac{e^2}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}\\right)\\right)=\\pi\\left(\\frac{e^2}{4}+\\frac{1}{4}\\right)=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\left(e^2+1\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
