   "questionHtml": "חשבו את השטח הכלוא בין הגרפים של הפונקציות: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\frac{3}{9+x^2},\\ y=\\frac{1}{1+x^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\frac{3}{9+x^2},\\qquad y=\\frac{1}{1+x^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3}{9+x^2}=\\frac{1}{1+x^2},\\qquad3+3x^2=9+x^2,\\qquad x^2=3,\\ x=\\pm\\sqrt{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=2S_1=2\\int_0^{\\sqrt{3}}\\left(\\frac{1}{1+x^2}-\\frac{3}{9+x^2}\\right)dx=2\\left(\\arctan x-3\\cdot\\frac{1}{3}\\arctan\\frac{x}{3}\\right)\\Big|_0^{\\sqrt{3}}=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2\\left(\\arctan\\sqrt{3}-\\arctan\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right)=2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)=\\frac{\\pi}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>תשובה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\pi}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
