   "questionHtml": "נתונה הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\begin{cases}\\ln\\left(a+e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}\\right), &amp; x&gt;0\\\\ \\ln^2\\left(a+x^2\\right), &amp; x\\le0\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>עבור אילו ערכי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span> הפונקציה רציפה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to0^+}f(x)=\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\ln\\left(a+e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}\\right)=\\ln a,\\qquad f(0)=\\ln^2a</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>על מנת שפונקציה תהיה רציפה יש לקיים:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to0^+}f(x)=f(0)\\Rightarrow\\ln a=\\ln^2a\\Rightarrow\\ln a(\\ln a-1)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln a=0\\Rightarrow a=1;\\quad\\ln a=1\\Rightarrow a=e</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
