   "question": "חשבו את האינטגרל הבא: $\\int\\frac{e^{-x}-e^x}{e^{-x}+e^x}\\,dx$.",
   "solution": "$$\\int\\frac{e^{-x}-e^x}{e^{-x}+e^x}dx=\\int\\frac{e^{-x}+e^x-e^x-e^x}{e^{-x}+e^x}dx$$\n$$=\\int dx-2\\int\\frac{e^x}{e^{-x}+e^x}dx=\\left|\\begin{matrix}t=e^x\\\\ dt=e^xdx\\end{matrix}\\right|$$\n$$=x-2\\int\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{t}+t}dt=x-2\\int\\frac{1}{\\frac{1+t^2}{t}}dt=x-2\\int\\frac{t}{1+t^2}dt$$\n$$=x-\\ln(1+x^2)+C=x-\\ln\\left(1+e^{2x}\\right)+C$$",
   "solutionSource": "official-pdf",
   "official": true,
