   "question": "חשבו את האינטגרל: $\\int\\frac{x^3-2x}{x^2+1}\\,dx$.",
   "solution": "$$\\int\\frac{x^3-2x}{x^2+1}dx\\left[x-\\frac{3x}{x^2+1}\\right]=\\int x\\,dx-\\int\\frac{3x}{x^2+1}dx=$$\n$$=\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{3}{2}\\int\\frac{d(x^2+1)}{x^2+1}dx=\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{3}{2}\\ln(x^2+1)+C$$",
