   "questionHtml": "חשבו את האינטגרל: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{x^3-2x}{x^2+1}\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{x^3-2x}{x^2+1}dx\\left[x-\\frac{3x}{x^2+1}\\right]=\\int x\\,dx-\\int\\frac{3x}{x^2+1}dx=</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{3}{2}\\int\\frac{d(x^2+1)}{x^2+1}dx=\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{3}{2}\\ln(x^2+1)+C</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
