   "questionHtml": "רשמו את משוואת המשיק לגרף של הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span> המוגדרת באמצעות משוואה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\pi x\\sin\\left(\\frac{y}{2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> בנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,\\pi)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=\\pi\\sin\\left(\\frac{y}{2}\\right)+\\pi x\\cos\\left(\\frac{y}{2}\\right)\\frac{y&#x27;}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=\\frac{\\pi\\sin\\left(\\frac{y}{2}\\right)}{1-\\frac{\\pi x}{2}\\cos\\left(\\frac{y}{2}\\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;(1)=\\frac{\\pi\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)}{1-\\frac{\\pi x}{2}\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)}=\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y-\\pi=\\pi(x-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\pi x</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
