   "questionHtml": "באמצעות נוסחת טיילור חשבו בקירוב <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mroot><mn>9</mn><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt[3]{9}</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ששגיאת החישוב תהיה קטנה מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mroot><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mroot><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=\\sqrt[3]{x}=x^{1/3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_0=8,\\ x=9,\\quad(x-x_0)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=\\frac{1}{3}x^{-\\frac{2}{3}},\\qquad y&#x27;(8)=\\frac{1}{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mroot><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mroot><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;&#x27;=-\\frac{2}{9}x^{-\\frac{5}{3}}=\\frac{-2}{9\\sqrt[3]{x^5}},\\qquad y&#x27;&#x27;(c)=\\frac{-2}{9\\sqrt[3]{c^5}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(9)=2+\\frac{1}{12}+R_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><mroot><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><mroot><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>288</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|R_1|=\\frac{1}{9\\sqrt[3]{c^5}}\\le\\frac{1}{9\\sqrt[3]{c^5}}=\\frac{1}{288}&lt;0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
