   "questionHtml": "חשבו את האינטגרל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{x^2\\,dx}{(x+2)(x^2+1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{x^2}{(x+2)(x^2+1)}=\\frac{A}{x+2}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2=A(x^2+1)+(Bx+C)(x+2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>הצבת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=-2</annotation></semantics></math></span> נותנת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4=5A</annotation></semantics></math></span>; מקדמי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> נותנים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A+B=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>; מקדמי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span> נותנים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2B+C=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\frac{4}{5},\\quad B=\\frac{1}{5},\\quad C=-\\frac{2}{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{x^2\\,dx}{(x+2)(x^2+1)}=\\frac{1}{5}\\int\\left(\\frac{4}{x+2}+\\frac{x-2}{x^2+1}\\right)dx=\\frac{1}{5}\\left(4\\ln|x+2|+\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(x^2+1)-2\\arctan x\\right)+C</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
