   "topicLabel": "משפטי ערך הביניים והממוצע",
   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו שמתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tan x&gt;x</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;x&lt;\\frac{\\pi}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\tan x</annotation></semantics></math></span> מקיימת את כל התנאים של משפט לגרנז' בתחום <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;x&lt;\\frac{\\pi}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>לכן קיימת נקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span> בקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,x)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, שבה מתקיים:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(c)=\\frac{\\tan x-\\tan 0}{x-0}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\frac{1}{\\cos^2 c}=\\frac{\\tan x}{x}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos^2 c&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ואז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\cos^2 c}&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מכאן נובע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\tan x}{x}&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tan x&gt;x</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "pointsTotal": 10,
   "pitfallsHtml": [
    "להפעיל לגרנז' על קטע שבו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tan</annotation></semantics></math></span> אינה רציפה: חייבים להישאר ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left[0,x\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&lt;\\frac\\pi2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
    "לשכוח שהאי-שוויון <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\cos^2c}&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span> דורש <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\neq0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, והנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span> בקטע הפתוח <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,x)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
    "לטעות בנגזרת של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tan</annotation></semantics></math></span>: היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\cos^2x}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ולא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\sin^2x}</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
   ]
