   "topicLabel": "רציפות",
   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו כי למשוואה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{\\sqrt{x}}+\\arctan(2x)=5</annotation></semantics></math></span> קיים פתרון ממשי אחד בלבד.",
   "solutionHtml": "נגדיר פונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=2^{\\sqrt{x}}+\\arctan(2x)-5</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>תחום ההגדרה של הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הפונקציה רציפה וגזירה בתחום <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הנגזרת היא:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msup><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}2^{\\sqrt{x}}\\ln2+\\frac{2}{1+4x^2}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msup><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}2^{\\sqrt{x}}\\ln2+\\frac{2}{1+4x^2}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span> ומכאן הפונקציה עולה ממש.<br>כמו כן, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0)=2^0+\\arctan(0)-5=-4</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ואם נסתכל על הגבול ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span>, נקבל: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}f(x)=\\infty+\\frac{\\pi}{2}-5=\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>לכן לפי משפט ערך הביניים קיימת נקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כך ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(c)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span> יחידה כי הפונקציה עולה ממש.",
