   "question": "חשבו את האינטגרל $\\int\\frac{x}{(x+1)(x^2+1)}\\,dx$.",
   "solution": "$$\\int\\frac{x}{(x+1)(x^2+1)}dx\\overset{(*)}{=}\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\left(\\frac{-1}{x+1}+\\frac{x+1}{x^2+1}\\right)dx=-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln|x+1|+\\frac{1}{4}\\int\\frac{2x+2}{x^2+1}dx$$\n$$=-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln|x+1|+\\frac{1}{4}\\ln|x^2+1|+\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 2\\cdot\\arctan x+c$$",
   "solutionSource": "official-pdf",
   "official": true,
   "confidence": "high",
