   "solution": "$$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{1+n+n^2}-\\sqrt{1-2n+n^2}\\right)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{\\left(\\sqrt{1+n+n^2}-\\sqrt{1-2n+n^2}\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{1+n+n^2}+\\sqrt{1-2n+n^2}\\right)}{\\sqrt{1+n+n^2}+\\sqrt{1-2n+n^2}}$$\n$$=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{1+n+n^2-(1-2n+n^2)}{\\sqrt{1+n+n^2}+\\sqrt{1-2n+n^2}}=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{3n}{\\sqrt{1+n+n^2}+\\sqrt{1-2n+n^2}}$$\n$$=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n^2}+\\frac{1}{n}+1}+\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n^2}-\\frac{2}{n}+1}}=\\frac{3}{2}.$$",
