   "year": 2025,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "נגזרות ומשיקים",
   "questionHtml": "מצאו את משוואת המשיק של גרף הפונקציה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=(\\tan x)^{\\cos x}</annotation></semantics></math></span> בנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "בנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)=1^{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>גזירה לוגריתמית: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln y=\\cos x\\cdot\\ln(\\tan x)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{y&#x27;}{y}=-\\sin x\\cdot\\ln(\\tan x)+\\cos x\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\tan x}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\cos^2x}=-\\sin x\\cdot\\ln(\\tan x)+\\frac{1}{\\sin x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=(\\tan x)^{\\cos x}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sin x}-\\sin x\\cdot\\ln(\\tan x)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)=1\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot\\ln1\\right)=\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>משוואת המשיק:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⟺</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y-1=\\sqrt{2}\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad y=\\sqrt{2}\\,x+1-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\,\\pi}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
