   "questionHtml": "חשבו את הגבול הבא: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to2}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+2}-\\sqrt{3x-2}}{\\sqrt{4x+1}-\\sqrt{5x-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "צורה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{0}{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. נכפיל את המונה ואת המכנה בצמודים:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{x+2}-\\sqrt{3x-2}=\\frac{(x+2)-(3x-2)}{\\sqrt{x+2}+\\sqrt{3x-2}}=\\frac{2(2-x)}{\\sqrt{x+2}+\\sqrt{3x-2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{4x+1}-\\sqrt{5x-1}=\\frac{(4x+1)-(5x-1)}{\\sqrt{4x+1}+\\sqrt{5x-1}}=\\frac{2-x}{\\sqrt{4x+1}+\\sqrt{5x-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>לכן, אחרי צמצום <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2-x\\neq0</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{x\\to2}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+2}-\\sqrt{3x-2}}{\\sqrt{4x+1}-\\sqrt{5x-1}}=\\lim_{x\\to2}\\frac{2\\left(\\sqrt{4x+1}+\\sqrt{5x-1}\\right)}{\\sqrt{x+2}+\\sqrt{3x-2}}=\\frac{2(3+3)}{2+2}=3</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
