   "question": "הוכיחו כי מתקיים האי שוויון: $e^{\\sin^2 b}-e^{\\sin^2 a}\\le e(b-a)$, עבור $-\\infty<a<b<\\infty$.",
   "solution": "נגדיר $f(x)=e^{\\sin^2x}$. הפונקציה רציפה וגזירה בכל $\\mathbb{R}$, ו-\n$$f'(x)=e^{\\sin^2x}\\cdot2\\sin x\\cos x=e^{\\sin^2x}\\sin2x$$\nלפי משפט לגרנז' על הקטע $[a,b]$ קיימת $c\\in(a,b)$ כך ש-\n$$e^{\\sin^2b}-e^{\\sin^2a}=f'(c)(b-a)=e^{\\sin^2c}\\sin2c\\cdot(b-a)$$\nמכיוון ש-$\\sin^2c\\le1$ ו-$\\sin2c\\le1$, מתקיים $e^{\\sin^2c}\\sin2c\\le e^{\\sin^2c}\\le e$ (אם $\\sin2c<0$ המכפלה שלילית וודאי קטנה מ-$e$). מכיוון ש-$b-a>0$:\n$$e^{\\sin^2b}-e^{\\sin^2a}\\le e(b-a)$$",
   "solutionSource": "solved",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "high",
   "part": "א",
   "points": 13,
   "id": "25B-B-Q5a",
   "partKey": "a",
   "examCode": "25B-B",
   "examLabel": "מבחן סוף סמסטר ב' תשפ\"ה, מועד ב'",
   "year": 2025,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "משפטי ערך הביניים והממוצע",
   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו כי מתקיים האי שוויון: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{\\sin^2 b}-e^{\\sin^2 a}\\le e(b-a)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\infty&lt;a&lt;b&lt;\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נגדיר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=e^{\\sin^2x}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הפונקציה רציפה וגזירה בכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ו-<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(x)=e^{\\sin^2x}\\cdot2\\sin x\\cos x=e^{\\sin^2x}\\sin2x</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>לפי משפט לגרנז' על הקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[a,b]</annotation></semantics></math></span> קיימת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\in(a,b)</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש-<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{\\sin^2b}-e^{\\sin^2a}=f&#x27;(c)(b-a)=e^{\\sin^2c}\\sin2c\\cdot(b-a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>c</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin^2c\\le1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin2c\\le1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{\\sin^2c}\\sin2c\\le e^{\\sin^2c}\\le e</annotation></semantics></math></span> (אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin2c&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span> המכפלה שלילית וודאי קטנה מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span>). מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b-a&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{\\sin^2b}-e^{\\sin^2a}\\le e(b-a)</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
