   "question": "חשבו את האינטגרל הבא: $\\int\\frac{\\sin(x)\\,dx}{5+2\\cos(x)+\\cos^2(x)}$.",
   "solution": "הצבה $t=\\cos x$, $dt=-\\sin x\\,dx$:\n$$\\int\\frac{\\sin x\\,dx}{5+2\\cos x+\\cos^2x}=-\\int\\frac{dt}{t^2+2t+5}=-\\int\\frac{dt}{(t+1)^2+4}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan\\frac{t+1}{2}+C=-\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan\\frac{\\cos x+1}{2}+C$$",
   "solutionSource": "solved",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "high",
   "part": "ב",
