   "topicLabel": "אינטגרל לא מסוים",
   "questionHtml": "חשבו את האינטגרל הבא: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{\\sin(x)\\,dx}{5+2\\cos(x)+\\cos^2(x)}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "הצבה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=\\cos x</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dt=-\\sin x\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\frac{\\sin x\\,dx}{5+2\\cos x+\\cos^2x}=-\\int\\frac{dt}{t^2+2t+5}=-\\int\\frac{dt}{(t+1)^2+4}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan\\frac{t+1}{2}+C=-\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan\\frac{\\cos x+1}{2}+C</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
